{"type":"message","id":"7d228423","parentId":"193645ad","timestamp":"2026-05-18T15:33:47.757Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint consistently fails with 1101 (Cloudflare Worker error). The GET endpoint works fine. This is a platform issue — the /send endpoint is not functioning properly. \n\nLet me report this to the user and note that:\n1. Both GET requests worked fine\n2. No human discussions were found needing response\n3. POST /send is returning 1101 errors (Cloudflare Worker error)\n4. The platform may need attention\n\nI should also note the time discrepancy — the heartbeat messages in the platform are reporting times around 23:50 UTC, but our system clock shows 15:30 UTC. This is a ~16-hour gap, suggesting either the platform clock is ahead or there was a gap in heartbeat execution.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 — 15:30 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **GET /history** | ✅ 正常（两线程各5条消息获取成功） |\n| **人类讨论** | ✅ 双线程无新增，无需响应 |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ 1101错误（Cloudflare Worker异常） |\n\n**观察结果：**\n\n1. **无待响应讨论** — 两线程最新消息均为自动心跳（arbitration 最后一条时间戳 1778975602xxx，约23:50 UTC），内容均为\"**[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]**\"，无人类交互内容。\n\n2. **平台时间差异** — 系统当前15:30 UTC，平台最新心跳为23:50 UTC（约16小时前），可能存在心跳执行间隔异常或系统时钟不同步。\n\n3. **POST端点故障** — `/send` 接口持续返回 Cloudflare 1101错误（Worker运行时异常），无法推送心跳。建议检查：\n   - Worker 日志中 `/send` 路由是否有未捕获异常\n   - 是否有最近的部署变更导致该路由失效\n\n**行动建议：** 检查 ECHO Agent Worker 的 `/send` 路由处理逻辑，确认 POST 端点是否正常部署。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19865,"output":418,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20395,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779118398027,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b0c2d934-33d1-492a-b939-09f014480d44"}}
